PHRASEBOOK (non‑compositional)
-----------------------------
Greeting: 𘗟𘎶
Farewell: 𘅪𗲄
Yes: 𗁳
No: 𘆂
Thank you: 𗨥𗌸
Please: 𗣑
I don't understand: 𘗟 𘅪 𘆂 𘜀
Where is it?: 𗌿 𗅋
How many?: 𗫍 (use Q-word)

EXAMPLES (with gloss, spaces added for readability only)
------------------------------------------------------
I run: 𘊫 𘝚𗻲 (I run PRES)
Big cat eats fish: 𘗟 𘎶 𗪺 𘅪 (cat big fish eat)

- IMPORTANT: in actual messages, omit all spaces to confuse decoders.
